Use io, list, and string.

Define function valid_parentheses taking text as a pointer to TcString returning a truth value:
    Let stack be List of byte.
    Let n be length of text.
    Let valid be true.
    For every i from 0 as an unsigned number to n - 1:
        Let c be text.data[i].
        If c equals 40 or c equals 91 or c equals 123:
            push c to address of stack.
        Otherwise:
            Let stack_size be count of stack.
            If stack_size is 0:
                Set valid to false.
                Break.
            Let top be pop from address of stack.
            If c equals 41 and top isn't 40:
                Set valid to false.
                Break.
            If c equals 93 and top isn't 91:
                Set valid to false.
                Break.
            If c equals 125 and top isn't 123:
                Set valid to false.
                Break.
    Let final_size be count of stack.
    If final_size isn't 0:
        Set valid to false.
    list_free(address of stack).
    Give back valid.
Done.

Let first be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("()[]{}"), bytes_len("()[]{}")).
Let second be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("([{}])"), bytes_len("([{}])")).
Let third be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("(]"), bytes_len("(]")).
Say valid_parentheses(address of first).
Say valid_parentheses(address of second).
Say valid_parentheses(address of third).
str_free(address of first).
str_free(address of second).
str_free(address of third).
Return 0.
